{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：09:53 2026-06-01 HKT<br/>發佈時間：09:53 2026-06-01 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：09:53 2026-06-01 HKT</p><p>長沙灣發生涉及單車的交通意外。今日（6月1日）早上8時34分，一輛紅頂小巴沿順寧道行駛，當駛至東沙島街交界時，一名踏電動單車的南亞裔男子突然由東沙島街駛出。小巴收掣不及，右邊車頭撞倒電動單車男，他額頭流血受傷幸清醒，其後獲送院治理。</p><p>現場所見小巴右邊車頭凹陷，擋風玻璃亦爆裂。涉事電動單車則倒在地上，警員其後檢走電動單車，正調查意外原因。</p><img alt=\"小巴撞倒電動單車漢。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fb07bb33098422dbb0a50f076f4dbb2f/2026-06/4.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"小巴右邊車頭凹陷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cc20621692931f2c34319ca9af1b93ec/2026-06/3_0.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bd231ec5a3c83d656da2e25024401f24/2026-06/2.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"小巴撞電動單車男，右邊車頭凹陷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f59f1483c3000d24212dc5e539e2d192/2026-06/1_2_0.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"小巴右邊擋風玻璃爆裂。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/877b428729e20e350effa9fa8781a944/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-01_at_09_29_51.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/27c46987a703d92d9a61c1cc323c3f3d/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-01_at_09_29_49_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"電動單車倒在地上。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9f22388eeaf02fb54713c50388342e90/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-01_at_09_29_49_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e18b72ff8929ea7a850a256cd7344163/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-01_at_09_29_49.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員在場調查意外原因。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ec4a43a12003dae78bef60496267c36e/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-01_at_09_29_48_1_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-01T02:39:19.354289+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":252,"images":9,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}